Lady Celina feels guilty. She did not notice that something interfered with her magic. Midranda, who was being banished to the infradimensions, was saved by a powerful force.
But that act weakened the dimensional fabric, causing several ruptures in space-time.

Dimensional rifts opened across the continent. The Royal Shamans and Royal Mages were tasked with repairing the flaws in the dimensional fabric and keeping portals from opening.

However, this portal stayed open and we could not close it. We do not know what may come out of it.

Your mission will be hard. Please, prepare your supplies and come talk to me again.
